# শেষ মুহূর্তের ১০টি Golden Rule

1. PCA = data reduction
2. FA = hidden factor detection
3. CCA = two variable sets-এর relationship
4. K-means = observations grouping
5. ICA = mixed signal separation
6. KMO \(>0.50\)
7. Bartlett \(p<0.05\)
8. `factanal()` sufficiency \(p>0.05\)
9. Canonical significance \(p<0.05\)
10. Loading/center interpret করতে absolute value, sign এবং variable meaning—তিনটিই দেখবেন।
